0.2 23oct2026
* Python 3 only: removed the Python 2 imports and the WeeWX 3 syslog fallback.
  WeeWX 4 or later is required.
* mask the hash in the URL that WeeWX logs with debug = 2 or higher. The
  code masked "key=", which is not a parameter of this protocol.
* do not write the hash to the log at startup.
* check the answer of temperatur.nu. It answers HTTP 200 also when it
  rejects a report, so a rejected upload was logged as published.
* do not send a record without outTemp. It produced a request with only
  the hash.
* default report URL is https://www.temperatur.nu/rapportera.php.
* do not start the uploader while the hash is still the placeholder
  TEMPERATURNU_HASH from the installer.
* pass skip_upload on to weewx.restx.RESTThread.
* remove the author e-mail address from the installer. It belonged to the
  author of the uploader this one is derived from.
* README follows the weewx-packages schema. Add smoke tests with a local
  HTTP server.

0.1 09aug2021
* initial version by Konrad Skeri Ekblad
